# AICL Example: Reverse Array
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Reverse in place

Layer:
Core

Behavior Reverse
    Input: array
    Output: array
    Action:
        left = 0
        right = len(array) - 1
        while left < right:
            array[left], array[right] = array[right], array[left]
            left = left + 1
            right = right - 1
        return array
